BaseVault_setCcipGasLimit
├── when the caller does not have the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
├── when the chain selector is zero
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroChainSelector
├── when the gas limit is zero
│   └── it should clear the per-chain override and emit CcipGasLimitSet
└── when the caller has the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
    └── it should set the CCIP gas limit and emit CcipGasLimitSet
